sequenceDiagram
    actor Client as 前端 (Vue3)
    participant LoginCtrl as LoginController
    participant UserSvc as SysUserServiceImpl
    participant SecUtil as SecurityUtil
    participant JwtUtil as JwtUtil
    participant DB as MySQL

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %% 1. 登录认证（含 BCrypt + MD5 兼容迁移）
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,DB: 场景1：用户登录（BCrypt验证 + MD5兼容迁移）

        Client->>LoginCtrl: POST /login {username:"admin", password:"123456"}
        LoginCtrl->>LoginCtrl: 校验 username/password 非空
        LoginCtrl->>UserSvc: login("admin", "123456")

        UserSvc->>DB: SELECT * FROM sys_user WHERE username='admin'
        DB-->>UserSvc: SysUser{userId:1, password:"$2a$10$...", role:2, status:1}

        Note over UserSvc: 尝试 BCrypt 匹配
        UserSvc->>SecUtil: matches("123456", "$2a$10$...")
        SecUtil-->>UserSvc: true ✅

        alt BCrypt 匹配失败 → MD5 兼容
            UserSvc->>SecUtil: isMd5Hash(user.password)
            SecUtil-->>UserSvc: true (旧 MD5 密码)
            UserSvc->>SecUtil: md5("123456")
            SecUtil-->>UserSvc: "e10adc3949ba59abbe56e057f20f883e"
            Note over UserSvc: MD5 匹配成功 → 自动升级
            UserSvc->>SecUtil: encode("123456")
            SecUtil-->>UserSvc: "$2a$10$new_hash..."
            UserSvc->>DB: UPDATE sys_user SET password='$2a$10$new_hash...' WHERE user_id=1
        end

        UserSvc-->>LoginCtrl: SysUser (认证成功)

        LoginCtrl->>JwtUtil: generateToken(1, "admin", 2)
        JwtUtil->>JwtUtil: 构建 Claims {sub:1, username:"admin", role:2, iat, exp}
        JwtUtil->>JwtUtil: HMAC-SHA256 签名
        JwtUtil-->>LoginCtrl: "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWI..."

        LoginCtrl-->>Client: {code:200, data:{token:"eyJ...", username:"admin", role:2, userId:1}}
    end

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %% 2. 认证拦截器
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,DB: 场景2：请求拦截验证（AuthInterceptor）

        Client->>Client: 从 localStorage 读取 token
        Note over Client: request.js 拦截器自动附加 header['token']

        Client->>Client: GET /user/list?current=1&size=10
        Note over Client: Header: token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...

        Note over Client: ═══ AuthInterceptor.preHandle() ═══

        Note over Client: 1. 检查是否为排除路径？(/login, /error, OPTIONS) → No

        Note over Client: 2. 从 request.getHeader("token") 提取 JWT

        Note over Client: 3. JwtUtil.validateToken(token)
        Note over Client:    → 解析 Claims → 验证签名 → 检查 exp

        alt Token 无效或过期
            Note over Client: 返回 HTTP 401 + {code:401, msg:"Token 已过期"}
        else Token 有效
            Note over Client: 4. 设置 request 属性
            Note over Client:    request.setAttribute("userId", 1)
            Note over Client:    request.setAttribute("username", "admin")
            Note over Client:    request.setAttribute("role", 2)
            Note over Client: 5. return true → 放行到 Controller
        end
    end

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %% 3. Department CRUD
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Client,DB: 场景3：Department CRUD（新增/修改）

        Client->>Client: POST /department/save
        Note over Client: AuthInterceptor 已验证通过

        participant DeptCtrl as DepartmentController
        participant DeptSvc as SysDepartmentServiceImpl

        Client->>DeptCtrl: POST /department/save {deptName:"技术部", deptCode:"TECH", sortOrder:1}
        DeptCtrl->>DeptSvc: saveDept(department)
        DeptSvc->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM sys_department WHERE dept_code='TECH'
        DB-->>DeptSvc: 0 (编码未重复)
        DeptSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO sys_department (dept_name, dept_code, ...) VALUES (...)
        DB-->>DeptSvc: 1 row inserted
        DeptSvc-->>DeptCtrl: true
        DeptCtrl-->>Client: {code:200, msg:"操作成功"}

        Client->>DeptCtrl: GET /department/1
        DeptCtrl->>DeptSvc: getDetail(1L)
        DeptSvc->>DB: SELECT * FROM sys_department WHERE dept_id=1
        DB-->>DeptSvc: SysDepartment{deptId:1, deptName:"技术部", ...}
        DeptSvc-->>DeptCtrl: SysDepartment
        DeptCtrl-->>Client: {code:200, data:{deptId:1, deptName:"技术部", ...}}
    end

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %% 4. RBAC 角色分配
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over Client,DB: 场景4：RBAC 权限分配

        participant RoleCtrl as RoleController
        participant PermCtrl as PermissionController
        participant RoleSvc as SysRoleServiceImpl
        participant PermSvc as SysPermissionServiceImpl

        Note over Client: 管理员为角色分配权限

        Client->>PermCtrl: GET /permission/list
        PermCtrl->>PermSvc: listTree()
        PermSvc->>DB: SELECT * FROM sys_permission ORDER BY sort_order
        DB-->>PermSvc: List~SysPermission~ (14条)
        Note over PermSvc: 组装树形结构 (parentId 嵌套)
        PermSvc-->>PermCtrl: 树形权限列表
        PermCtrl-->>Client: {code:200, data:[{permissionId:1,...children:[...]}]}

        Client->>PermCtrl: POST /permission/assign {roleId:2, permissionIds:[1,2,3,5,6,...]}
        PermCtrl->>PermSvc: assignPermissions(2L, [1,2,3,5,6,...])
        PermSvc->>DB: DELETE FROM sys_role_permission WHERE role_id=2
        PermSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO sys_role_permission (role_id, permission_id) VALUES (2,1),(2,2),...
        DB-->>PermSvc: batch insert OK
        PermSvc-->>PermCtrl: true
        PermCtrl-->>Client: {code:200, msg:"权限分配成功"}
    end

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %% 5. 前端角色控制
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    rect rgb(255, 255, 230)
        Note over Client,DB: 场景5：前端按钮角色控制

        Note over Client: AssetScrap.vue 渲染时
        Note over Client: const userRole = parseInt(localStorage.getItem('role'))
        Note over Client: → userRole = 2 (管理员)

        Note over Client: &lt;template v-if="userRole === 2"&gt;
        Note over Client:   通过按钮 / 拒绝按钮 → 可见 ✅
        Note over Client: &lt;/template&gt;

        Note over Client: AssetInventory.vue 渲染时（普通用户）
        Note over Client: → userRole = 1

        Note over Client: &lt;template v-if="userRole === 2"&gt;
        Note over Client:   新建盘点 / 开始盘点 / 完成盘点 → 隐藏 ❌
        Note over Client: &lt;/template&gt;
    end
